3488: | nameless_description (75) | **84.0** | **96.0** | 82.7 | 82.7 | 78.7 | 90.7 | 90.7 |
3489: | ordinal_relative (80) | **93.8** | 81.2 | 81.2 | 60.0 | 62.5 | 63.8 | 88.8 |
